WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.560
Your instructor is one of the finest pilots this program has ever produced.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.400
His exploits

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.700
are legendary.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.920
What he has to teach you

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.100
may very will mean the difference between life

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.180
and death.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.740
your reputation precedes you.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:07.120
I have to admit, I wasn't expecting an invitation back.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.080
They're called orders, Maverick.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.240
Good morning aviators

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.420
this is your captain speaking

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.300
today's exercise is dogfighting.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.860
2 vs 1? He's got to be kidding.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.040
What the hell!?!

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.840
Smoke in the air! Break right! Break right!

